# NAME|INPUT|RC|EXPECT
# EXPECT starting with ! asserts absence.
# The ai module, the first converted leaf. These exercise the leaf itself
# rather than stopping at the dispatcher, since FnAiClaude now exists.
base-case|ConsideraWeb api ai claude -d|0|LPRE:RUN fn=FnAiClaude suite=consideraweb project=api
base-case-resolves-path|ConsideraWeb api ai claude -d|0|ConsideraWeb.Api
prompt-positional|ConsideraWeb api ai claude fix the bug -d|0|prompt=fix the bug
prompt-via-a|ConsideraWeb api ai claude -a fix the bug -d|0|prompt=fix the bug
here-flag-forwarded|ConsideraWeb api ai claude --here -d|0|flags=--here -d
# No project: the leaf fans out through FnEtcForEachProject and re-enters once
# per internal project, so one invocation reports many.
all-projects-fans-out|ConsideraWeb ai claude -d|0|project=api
all-projects-reaches-last|ConsideraWeb ai claude -d|0|project=unity-workspace
all-projects-skips-external|ConsideraWeb ai claude -d|0|!project=proxy
selected-projects|ConsideraWeb ai claude -p api bff -d|0|project=bff
selected-single|ConsideraWeb ai claude -p mcp -d|0|project=mcp
selected-excludes-others|ConsideraWeb ai claude -p mcp -d|0|!project=api
prompt-survives-fanout|ConsideraWeb ai claude -p api bff -a hello -d|0|prompt=hello
unknown-project-rejected|ConsideraWeb ai claude -p nosuchproject -d|1|Unknown project
